# The only direction word that follows the count it governs: "dois anos
# atrás".  "em", "dentro de" and "daqui a" are prepositions and precede it
# (Priberam s.v. "em": "preposição ... 2. Usa-se para indicar tempo"), so
# "dois anos em maio" is not "in two years".  "atras" is "atrás" without
# its accent, as text typed or transcribed without diacritics writes it.
atrás
atras
